OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a bright day with a
OL,6,Fmixture of sunny intervals and
OL,7,Foccasional showers. Some of these
OL,8,Fshowers could be briefly heavy. Fresh
OL,9,Fto strong southwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers will become more
OL,12,Fscattered tonight with some longer dry
OL,13,Fspells though there will be quite a
OL,14,Flot of cloud. Winds easing down.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FA cloudy start then
OL,17,Fbrightening up from the south with
OL,18,Fsome good spells of sunshine. Moderate
OL,19,Fsoutherly breeze and a bit milder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
